NOTICE

This repository is a fork of sm64coopdx with a browser (WebAssembly) build, a relay server
(server/) and a Discord Activity integration added on top.

Upstream code
-------------
- sm64coopdx by the Coop Deluxe Team, https://github.com/coop-deluxe/sm64coopdx
  Imported from upstream commit 8cd6e59 (as commit e3ff0d8 in this repository).
  sm64coopdx continues sm64ex-coop by djoslin0 (https://github.com/djoslin0/sm64ex-coop) and
  builds on the sm64ex PC port.
- The Super Mario 64 decompilation project, https://github.com/n64decomp/sm64

